  "id": "868319281",
  "title": "IPEX Automation test approach & scope of Automation",
  "url": "https://i-p-e-x.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=868319281",
  "content": "<ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"03ceca94-50a6-42de-9173-6e5b4d8661a8\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>This page is out of date with the current strategy. It needs to be cleaned up, but not necessarily deleted. The current tool of choice for IPEX for E2E and Component testing is Cypress.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"jira\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"22acbae3-f67a-4342-ba2f-18080b72d1ef\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"server\">System JIRA</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"serverId\">70cd962b-65cc-357d-b445-58d5af5f9e17</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"key\">PE-53</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>&nbsp;</h2><h2>Purpose:</h2><ul><li>The primary purpose of this document is to provide a minimum test coverage and areas of importance for test automation for the projects in IPEX which practice test automation. The document doesn't enable with an End to End test automation strategy, but acts as a reference &quot;Automation test process&quot; guideline for projects or areas in IPEX.</li><li>Also this document helps with an initial structure on how to incorporate automation into the test process, tools, framework etc.</li></ul><p><br /></p><h2>Proposed Tool:</h2><ul><li>Automation tool: <strong>Selenium</strong></li><li>Framework: <strong>Depends on the project and code base</strong></li><li>Documentation: <strong>Confluence</strong></li><li>Test case and Defect management:&nbsp;<strong>JIRA</strong></li><li>Script Repository: <strong>GIT Hub/Bit-bucket&nbsp;or project's source code repository</strong></li></ul><h2>Define Scope and test cases :</h2><p><br /></p><ul><li>Identify areas where Automation can&nbsp; be used for unit testing, functionality, Integration , APIs, Sanity/smoke tests, End to End tests etc.</li><li>Test cases should be written and a scenario must be defined for all test types.</li><li>All test cases should be defined in&nbsp;Jira and tagged to the feature/business enhancement it is supposed to address.</li></ul><p>An example or template for Test case matrix is below:<strong> Open for improvisation&nbsp;</strong></p><table class=\"relative-table wrapped\" style=\"width: 77.4828%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 2.18695%;\" /></colgroup><colgroup><col style=\"width: 27.5838%;\" /></colgroup><colgroup><col style=\"width: 5.85538%;\" /></colgroup><colgroup><col style=\"width: 3.1746%;\" /></colgroup><colgroup><col style=\"width: 2.89242%;\" /></colgroup><colgroup><col style=\"width: 3.03351%;\" /></colgroup><colgroup><col style=\"width: 3.10406%;\" /></colgroup><colgroup><col style=\"width: 4.30335%;\" /></colgroup><colgroup><col style=\"width: 16.3668%;\" /></colgroup><colgroup><col style=\"width: 6.27866%;\" /></colgroup><colgroup><col style=\"width: 7.90123%;\" /></colgroup><colgroup><col style=\"width: 5.50265%;\" /></colgroup><colgroup><col style=\"width: 5.00882%;\" /></colgroup><colgroup><col /><col style=\"width: 6.34921%;\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th style=\"text-align: center;\"><h3><strong>#</strong></h3></th><th style=\"text-align: center;\"><h3><strong>Test Scenario &amp; Test Cases</strong></h3><p><strong>(Eligible for Automation)</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"6\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><h3><strong>Test Type/Scope </strong></h3><h3><strong>Matrix</strong><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></h3></th><th style=\"text-align: center;\"><h3><strong>Status</strong></h3><h3><strong>Complete/In-Progress/Blocked</strong></h3><h3><strong>(Reason if blocked, should be commented)</strong></h3></th><th colspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><h3><strong>Jira Reference</strong></h3></th><th colspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><h3><strong>Jira</strong></h3><h3><strong>Feature/Story Reference</strong></h3></th><th colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><h3><strong>Defect Reference and Status</strong></h3></th></tr><tr><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><em><strong>Functional</strong></em></td><td><em><strong>Unit Test</strong></em></td><td><em><strong>API</strong></em></td><td><em><strong>E2E</strong></em></td><td colspan=\"1\"><em><strong>BAT</strong></em></td><td><em><strong>Smoke</strong></em></td><td><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>Jira</strong></p><p><strong>Existing Defect Reference</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Severity&nbsp;</strong></p><p>(Critical/Major/</p><p>Medium/Minor)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>Priority</strong></p><p>(Highest,High,</p><p>Medium,Low)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><strong>Environment</strong></td></tr><tr><td><br /></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Invoke Application (Scenario 1)</strong></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>test case description 1</td><td>Y</td><td>N</td><td>N</td><td>Y</td><td colspan=\"1\">Y</td><td>Y</td><td class=\"highlight-green\" data-highlight-colour=\"green\">Complete</td><td colspan=\"1\">#</td><td colspan=\"1\">#</td><td colspan=\"1\">#</td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>test case description 2</td><td>Y</td><td>Y</td><td>Y</td><td>N</td><td colspan=\"1\">N</td><td>Y</td><td class=\"highlight-yellow\" data-highlight-colour=\"yellow\">In-Progress</td><td colspan=\"1\">#</td><td colspan=\"1\">#</td><td colspan=\"1\">#</td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>test case description 3</td><td>N</td><td>Y</td><td>Y</td><td>N</td><td colspan=\"1\">N</td><td>N</td><td class=\"highlight-red\" data-highlight-colour=\"red\">Blocked (Why? short description)</td><td colspan=\"1\">#</td><td colspan=\"1\">#</td><td colspan=\"1\">#</td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td></tr><tr><td><br /></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>XYZ (Scenario 2)</strong></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td><br /></td><td class=\"highlight-yellow\" data-highlight-colour=\"yellow\">In-Progress</td><td colspan=\"1\">#</td><td colspan=\"1\">#</td><td colspan=\"1\">#</td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>test case description 4</td><td>Y</td><td>N</td><td>N</td><td>Y</td><td colspan=\"1\">N</td><td>N</td><td class=\"highlight-green\" data-highlight-colour=\"green\">Complete</td><td colspan=\"1\">#</td><td colspan=\"1\">#</td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\">5</td><td colspan=\"1\">test case description 5</td><td colspan=\"1\">Y</td><td colspan=\"1\">N</td><td colspan=\"1\">N</td><td colspan=\"1\">N</td><td colspan=\"1\">Y</td><td colspan=\"1\">Y</td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\">#</td><td colspan=\"1\">#</td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\">6</td><td colspan=\"1\">test case description 6</td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>ABC (Scenario 3)</strong></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\">7</td><td colspan=\"1\">test case description 7</td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td><td colspan=\"1\"><br /></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><h2>Minimum Automation Coverage (Recommended):</h2><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup><col /><col /><col /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th>Test Type</th><th>Automation coverage</th><th>Manual Test Coverage</th></tr><tr><td>Unit Test</td><td>90%</td><td>10%</td></tr><tr><td>Integration Test</td><td>75%</td><td>25%</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\">Functional Test</td><td colspan=\"1\">75%</td><td colspan=\"1\">25%</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\">API test</td><td colspan=\"1\">75%</td><td colspan=\"1\">25%</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\">BAT</td><td colspan=\"1\">25%</td><td colspan=\"1\">75%</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\">Smoke Test</td><td colspan=\"1\">100%</td><td colspan=\"1\">0%</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\">Regression Test suite</td><td colspan=\"1\">75%</td><td colspan=\"1\">25%</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\">Usability Test</td><td colspan=\"1\">0%</td><td colspan=\"1\">100%</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Scope of Automation in CI-CD Setup:</h2><ul><li>There is no scope definition which fits all in CI-CD and integration of automation suite in the build pipeline.</li><li>It is a flexible approach and should be evaluated by projects individually which can fit their delivery structure.</li></ul><p>A recommendation is provided below just for reference.</p><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"drawio\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"fad4c10b-f5ae-46e3-8027-7f507df18c78\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"contentId\">874446922</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"simple\">0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"zoom\">1</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"inComment\">0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"pageId\">868319281</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"diagramDisplayName\">IPEXTestAutomationScope</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"lbox\">1</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"contentVer\">6</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"revision\">6</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"baseUrl\">https://i-p-e-x.atlassian.net/wiki</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"diagramName\">Untitled Diagram.drawio</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"aspect\">undefined</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"width\">1239</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"links\" /><ac:parameter ac:name=\"tbstyle\" /><ac:parameter ac:name=\"height\">1021</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p><p><br /></p><h2>Reporting:</h2><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p>",
